
Star OS live environment - prototype M0.1

This is an unsigned test build. It has no desktop and no Star OS installer
yet. It is built from the Arch Linux live environment, so Arch tools such as
archinstall are present, but they are not the Star OS installer.

Do not use this image to install a system you depend on.
Report what you find: https://github.com/Jayyy-tuff/Star-OS/issues

